# src/apps/daemon/internal/protocols/tarpit

## Purpose
Platform-aware socket tarpit behavior, rate/lifecycle control, native bridge integration, and local structured logging.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `protocols` (rank 1; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (7): `logger.go`, `logger_test.go`, `socket_linux.go`, `socket_other.go`, `socket_windows.go`, `tarpit.go`, `tarpit_test.go`

