- Notable exported surface: `GetTarpitServer`, `Level`, `TarpitServer`.
- Daemon-local dependencies: `internal/foundation/redact`, `internal/native/bridge`.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/adapters/api`, `internal/adapters/mobilebind`.

## Invariants
